  "goodToKnow": "Die Laufzeit is the term or duration of something that runs: die Laufzeit eines Vertrags, eines Kredits, eines Handyvertrags (often 24 months in Germany). A film's running time is also its Laufzeit. In German energy politics, die Laufzeitverlängerung, extending the operating life of nuclear power plants, was a fierce debate; the last three plants were shut down in April 2023. In computing, die Laufzeit means runtime."
